From 115ae4c75cc1095e5b5dd6c23ccd3e65e96b9b05 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:18:33 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] test(slot): read the rows as the prefix and pin the wall
 lap

The slot suite collected every feed point of a level. The wall lap of #2906 adds its moves after the rows, so these tests now read the rows as the prefix, pin the lap (four quarter arcs, its direction, its tips), and count only descending arcs as the helix.

Refs #2906

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
